{"id": "EUVD-2026-72153", "enisaUuid": "dd1d3f00-505c-35df-a291-4fe460c3253e", "description": "When libpsl support is enabled, libcurl fails to enforce the Public Suffix\nList boundary check when processing a `Set-Cookie` header where the `Domain`\nattribute explicitly matches an origin host that is itself a public suffix\n(e.g., `Domain=co.uk` set by `co.uk`).\n\nInstead of coercing it into a strict host-only cookie, libcurl saves the\ncookie with wildcard domain scope (`.co.uk`). Consequently, the cookie is\ninappropriately included in subsequent outbound requests or HTTP redirects to\narbitrary sibling subdomains under the same public suffix (e.g.,\n`attacker.co.uk`).", "datePublished": "2026-09-06T17:49:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T06:03:16", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-82209.json", "https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-82209.html", "https://hackerone.com/reports/3972385"], "aliases": ["GHSA-3hpw-4mfr-9f85", "CVE-2026-82209"], "assigner": "curl", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "027620de-bdf1-3c6a-a39d-d9e30a5a534a", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.66.0"}, {"id": "04f7c50b-087b-3bd9-a6b7-aed13490f2fd", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.5.0"}, {"id": "051aaf2b-3a39-3a7c-9ece-62ba6810d573", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.76.0"}, {"id": "058397b3-aa10-31cf-a456-9ca87ebb3d89", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.47.1"}, {"id": "070f7df8-e7aa-39cd-aeaf-72cc58a9f863", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.9.1"}, {"id": "073d646b-9f57-3d10-8592-d80dcd6a6135", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.53.0"}, {"id": "0deafb97-2e65-3f09-9197-31790579d5c8", "product": {"name": "curl",